"Deep under the Whitecombs a Depths-Twisted Aberrant is waking, and the storms are its stirring."
"The tidepools opening along the Whitecombs this winter are the Horizon failing above it."
"Hollow Tarn is the largest of four tidepools opened along the Whitecombs since midwinter."
"The midwinter quakes that split the greymaws' cliff were the waking Aberrant's first stirring."
